/*
 * ESN Architecture on this MCU:
 *
 *  Pipeline 1 — ESN CLASSIFIER (this file, active on STM32)
 *    weights  : esn_classifier_weights.h  (auto-generated by train_classifier.py)
 *    inputs   : [Voltage, Current, Temperature]   (3 features)
 *    reservoir: 50 nodes, spectral_radius=0.95, leak_rate=0.3
 *    outputs  : [Normal=0, Warning=1, Critical=2] (thermal safety class)
 *    inference: float32 + Q15 fixed-point side-by-side for validation
 *
 *  Pipeline 2 — ESN ESTIMATOR (software-only, NOT included here)
 *    weights  : esn_estimator_weights.h  (generated by train_estimator.py)
 *    inputs   : [Voltage, Current, Voltage_grad, Current_ma]  (4 features)
 *    reservoir: SOC=500 nodes, SOH=400 nodes
 *    outputs  : SOC (float 0-1), SOH (float 0-1)
 *    NOTE: Dense W_res at 500 nodes = 1 MB RAM — exceeds STM32F4 SRAM budget.
 *          SOC/SOH estimation runs on the Python visualiser instead.
 *          Hardware-side cross-validation is done offline via train_estimator.py.
 */
